                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="title inscriptio" xml:id="Incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>Incipit</t:label>
                    <t:ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩፡ አምላክ። ንጽሕፍ፡ ዜና፡ ተአምሪሁ፡ ወዕበየ፡ ትሩፋቲሁ፡ ለዝንቱ፡ ጻድቅ፡ አቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ ዘውገ፡ ፋሲለደስ፡ ሰማዕት፡ ዘገብረ፡ እምድኅረ፡ ሞቱ፡</t:ab>
                </t:div>
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="supplication" xml:id="SupplicationTM" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>Supplication</t:label>
                    <t:ab>ጸሎቱ፡
                        ትኵኖ፡ ወበረከተ፡ አምላኩ፡ ወትንብናሃ፡ ለእግዝእትነ፡ ማርያም፡ ጸሎታ፡ ወበረከታ፡ የሃሉ።</t:ab>
                </t:div>
                
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="FirstMiracle" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>First miracle: Healing of the sick by touching pieces of ʾAbuna ʾAnānyā's shroud</t:label>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Miracle1" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>Miracle 1</t:label>
                        <t:ab>ቀዳሚ፡ ተአምር፡ ዘገብረ፡ አቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ ዘኤላ፡ ገዳማተ፡ ወአድባራተ፡ ወምኔታተ፡ ወከመ፡ አቡሁ፡ ዘከፈለ፡ ባሕረ፡ ግርምተ፡ ወበከመ፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ ዘኮነ፡ ሰማዕተ፡ 
                            ወከመ፡ ኤልያስ፡ ዘዓቀበ፡ ደመናተ፡ ወከመ፡ ጳውሎስ፡ ዘአንኃ፡ ስብከተ፡ ወከመ፡ ጴጥሮስ፡ ዘትወፈየ፡ መራኁተ፡ ወተሰቅለ፡ ቍልቍሊተ። ወበ፩፡ እመዋዕል፡ መጽኡ፡ ብዙኃን፡ 
                            ድውያን፡ ወሕሙማን፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወይብሉ፡ ዘይፈውሱ፡ ድውያነ፡ በዘፈረ፡ ልብሱ፡ ኢርኢነ፡ ወኢሰማዕነ፡ ዘእንበለ፡ እግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ 
                            ዘፈውሰ፡ በዘፈረ፡ ልብሱ፡ ወዘእንበለ፡ አርዳኢሁ፡ ወሐዋርያቲሁ፡ ውእቱኒ፡ ኢያሕፀፀ፡ እምኔሆሙ፡ በገቢረ፡ ተአምራት፡ ወመንክራት፡ ጸሎቱ። <t:gap reason="omitted"/></t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Arke1" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>ʿĀrke-hymn 1</t:label>
                        <t:ab>ሰላም፡ ለልብከ፡ ፈዋሴ፡ ሕማም፡ ወደዌ፡ ወእምነ፡ ኵሉ፡ ምንሳዌ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/>ወእምነ፡ እሳት፡ ነነዌ፡ በስብሐተ፡ ነቢይ፡ ዮናስ፡ አልቦቱ፡ ሕሳዌ።
                                </t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                </t:div>
                
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="SecondMiracle" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>Second miracle: Ending of a famine with the help of relics of ʾAbuna ʾAnānyā and ʾAbuna Ṗawlos</t:label>
                    <t:note>During a famine in <t:placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC5575Saraye">Sarāye</t:placeName>, while drought reigned and there was an invasion of 
                        locusts, monks stole the skull of <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1906Ananyao">ʾAnānyā</t:persName> and the sole of the foot of
                        <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7769Pawlos">Ṗawlos</t:persName> from the monastery of <t:placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC2358DabraS">Dabra Ṣarābi</t:placeName>. 
                        These relics put an end to the famine and thirst, and made the locusts disappear.</t:note>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Miracle2" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>Miracle 2</t:label>
                        <t:ab>ተአምሪሁ፡ ለብፁዕ፡ ወለቅዱስ፡ ትሩፈ፡ ምግባር፡ አቡነ፡ ጻድቅ፡ ወሰማዕት፡ አቡነ፡ አናንያ። እምብዕለ፡ ዓለም፡ ለመንግሥተ፡ ሰማያት፡ ዘኃረያ፡ ጸሎቱ። ወበ፩፡ 
                            እመዋዕል፡ መጽኡ፡ መነኮሳት፡ ተማኪሮሙ፡ ምስለ፡ ሰብአ፡ ሰራዌ፡ ወኮነ፡ በሀገሮሙ፡ አባረ፡ እክል፡ ወጽምዓ፡ ማይ፡ በእንተ፡ ኃጢአ፡ ዝናም፡ ወበልዓ፡ 
                            አን<t:choice resp="PRS8999Strelcyn"><t:sic>ቦ</t:sic><t:corr>በ</t:corr></t:choice>ጣ፡ ፍሬ፡ ምድሮሙ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/>
                            ወኮኑ፡ ይፈውሱ፡ ኵሎ፡ ድውያነ፡ እስከ፡ ዛቲ፡ ዕለት፡ እስመ፡ ንጹሕ፡ ወክቡር፡ እዕፅምቲሆሙ፡ ለጻድቃን፡ አበው፡ ጸሎቶ። <t:gap reason="omitted"/></t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Arke2" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>ʿĀrke-hymn 2</t:label>
                        <t:ab>ሰላም፡ አዕፅምቲክሙ፡ ዘትይፌውሱ፡ ድውያነ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወንጽሕናክሙ፡ ያንጽሕ፡ ሥጋነ።</t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                </t:div>
                
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="ThirdMiracle" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>Third miracle: How holy water from ʾAnānyā’s shroud prevents grasshoppers from coming near</t:label>
                    <t:note>The water in which a piece of the shroud of <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1906Ananyao">ʾAnānyā</t:persName> had been soaked prevented 
                        grasshoppers from touching the grain that has been sprinkled with it.</t:note>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Miracle3" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>Miracle 3</t:label>
                        <t:ab>ተአምሪሁ፡ ለአቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወነበሩ፡ ፪ አኃው፡ ፩ ወሬዛ፡ ወ፩ መነኮስ። ወንብረቶሙ፡ 
                            ለ፪ሆሙ። አኃቲ፡ ገራኅት፡ ወተከፍለት፡ በዕፃ፡ ወበአኃቲ፡ ዕለት፡ <t:pb n="13v"/> መጽአ፡ አንበጣ። ወውእቱኒ፡ ወሬዛ፡ ሐፀበ፡ በማይ፡ እምልብሰ፡ መግንዙ፡
                            ለአቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ ወነዝኃ፡ ማየ፡ ጸሎት፡ ለይእቲ፡ ገራህት፡ ዘተከፍለት፡ በዕፃ፡ እንዘ፡ ክድንት፡ ይእቲ፡ ኵለንታሃ፡ በአን<t:sic>ቦ</t:sic>ጣ፡ ወኢጥዕመ፡ አንቦጣ፡
                            እምፍሬ፡ እክል። <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወእለ፡ ርእዩ፡ ሰብእ፡ አንከሩ፡ ወተ<t:add place="above"><t:unclear>ጻ</t:unclear></t:add>ሙ፡
                            እምዕበየ፡ ተአምራቲሁ፡ ለንጹሕ፡ ወቅዱስ፡ ኅሩይ፡ መስተጋድ፡ ጸ<t:supplied reason="omitted" resp="CH">ሎቱ፡</t:supplied>
                            <t:gap reason="omitted"/></t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Arke3" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>ʿĀrke-hymn 3</t:label>
                        <t:ab>አዘሰርከ፡ አፈ፡ አንቦጣ፡ በላዒ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> አናንያ፡ ካህን፡ ቢጸ፡ ሱራፌል፡ ሠዋዒ፡ በጸሎትከ፡ አባ፡ አድኅነኒ፡ እምዕደ፡ ጽኑዕ፡ መዋዒ፡ 
                            ወኢይገድፈኒ፡ ብዕሲ፡ ገፋዒ። ።</t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                </t:div>
                
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="FourthMiracle" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>Fourth miracle: Healing of a man from elephantiasis</t:label>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Miracle4" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>Miracle 4</t:label>
                        <t:ab>ተአምሪሁ፡ ለአቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወበ፩ እመዋዕል፡ መጽአ፡ ፩ ብእሲ፡ እምሀገረ፡ ተንቤን፡ ዘደወየ፡ በሕማመ፡ ዝልጋሴ፡ ወሶበ፡ ሰምዓ፡
                            ዜና፡ ገድሉ፡ ወኂሩቱ፡ ወተአምሪሁ፡ ከመ፡ ይፌውስ፡ ድውያነ፡ ወያርትዕ፡ ኃንካሳነ፡ ወይሁብ፡ ለዕውራን፡ ብርሃነ። <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወተግበር፡ ተዝካሮሙ፡
                            ለጻድቃን፡ እስከ፡ ዕለተ፡ ሞታ፡ ጸሎ<t:supplied reason="omitted" resp="CH">ቱ፡</t:supplied><t:gap reason="omitted"/></t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Arke4" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>ʿĀrke-hymn 4</t:label>
                        <t:ab><t:supplied reason="omitted" resp="CH">ኦዘፈወስከ፡</t:supplied> ለብእሲ፡ እምዝልጋሴ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/>
                            ወደምስሶ፡ ድምሳሴ፡ ከመ፡ ለደታን፡ ወአቤሮን፡ ደምሰሶሙ፡ ሙሴ። ።</t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                </t:div>
                
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="FifthMiracle" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>Fifth miracle: Healing of a blind woman</t:label>
                    <t:note>The two monks carrying the relics of <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1906Ananyao">ʾAnānyā</t:persName> and 
                        <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7769Pawlos">Ṗawlos</t:persName> entered the house of a blind woman who was healed on the spot.</t:note>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Miracle5" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>Miracle 5</t:label>
                        <t:ab>ተአምሪሁ፡ ለአቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ ጻድቅ፡ ከመ፡ ኤልያስ፡ ፃማዊ፡ በከመ፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ መዓዊ፡ ጸሎ<t:gap reason="omitted"/> ወበ፩ እመዋዕል፡ እንዘ፡ የሃውሩ፡ 
                            ፪ መነኮሳት፡ ጸዊሮሙ፡ ርእሶ፡ ለአቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ ወአገዳ፡ እግሩ፡ ለአቡነ፡ ጳውሎስ፡ በጊዜ፡ ምሴት፡ ውስተ፡ ቤተ፡ አሐቲ፡ <t:sic>ዕውርቲ፡</t:sic> ወሶበ፡ ቦኡ፡ ውስተ፡ ቤታ፡
                            ተከሥተ፡ አዕይንቲሃ፡ ወኮነት፡ <t:sic>ሕያውታ፡</t:sic> <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወይቤልዋ፡ አኮ፡ አማልክት፡ ንኅነ፡ አላ፡ አምላከ፡ ጻድቃን፡ ፈወሰኪ፡ ዳእሙ፡ 
                            ገበረ፡ ተዝካሮሙ፡ ለጻድቃን፡ አበው፡ አቡነ፡ ጳውሎስ፡ ወአቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ ዘአህየወኪ፡ ዓይነኪ፡ 
                            ጸሎ<t:supplied reason="omitted" resp="CH">ቶሙ፡</t:supplied><t:gap reason="omitted"/></t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Arke5" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>ʿĀrke-hymn 5</t:label>
                        <t:note>The following ʿārke-hymn is not attested in <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ANLcr90">Rome, Biblioteca dell’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei, Conti Rossini 90</t:ref>, but taken from
                            <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESky066">ʾƎndartā, Koholo Yoḥannǝs Dabra Betel, KY-066</t:ref>.</t:note>
                        <t:ab>ኦመተንብላን፡ አናንያ፡ ወጳውሎስ። መ<t:pb n="35ra"/>ምሕራነ፡ ወንጌል፡ ሐዲስ። <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወለለዕለቱ፡ ሐውፅዋ፡ ለዛቲ፡ መቅደስ።</t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                </t:div>
                
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="SixthMiracle" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>Sixth miracle: Healing of a pregnant woman</t:label>
                    <t:note>A woman who was about to give birth fell seriously ill. She recovered after coming into contact with a piece of the shroud
                        of <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1906Ananyao">ʾAnānyā</t:persName>.</t:note>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Miracle6" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>Sixth Miracle</t:label>
                        <t:ab>ተአምሪሁ፡ ለአቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ ጻድቅ፡ ወምእመን፡ ጸሎቱ። ወሐመት፡ አሐቲ፡ ብእሲት፡ ጽንስት፡ ወአሐዛ፡ ሕማመ፡ ወሊድ፡ ወአልጸቀት፡ ለሞት፡ ወሐመት፡ ብዙኃ፡ 
                            መዋዕለ፡ ወአምጽኡ፡ ብዙኃ፡ ፈውሰ፡ ወኢተፈወሰት፡ ምንተኒ፡ እምሕማማ፡ ወነ<t:pb n="14v"/>በሩ፡ አቡሃ፡ ወእማ፡
                            ወ<t:add place="above">አ</t:add>ዝማዲሃ፡ ወብዙኃ፡ ግዓረት፡ ወኃዘኑ፡ ኵሎሙ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወሶቤሃ፡ ተፈወት፡ በቅጽበት፡ ወወለደት፡ 
                            ወልደ፡ ወገብሩ፡ ይባቤ፡ እለ፡ ነበሩ፡ ጉቡአን፡ ሰብእ፡ ጸሎቱ። <t:gap reason="omitted"/></t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                    <t:div type="textpart" subtype="miracle" xml:id="Arke6" xml:lang="gez">
                        <t:label>ʿĀrke-hymn 6</t:label>
                        <t:note>The following ʿārke-hymn is not attested in <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ANLcr90">Rome, Biblioteca dell’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei, Conti Rossini 90</t:ref>, but taken from
                            <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESky066">ʾƎndartā, Koholo Yoḥannǝs Dabra Betel, KY-066</t:ref>.</t:note>
                        <t:ab>ኦዘፈወሰከ፡ እምሕማመ፡ ወሊድ፡ ጽኑዕ። አምጣነ፡ አንተ፡ ብፁዕ። <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ምስለ፡ ካህናት፡ ፳ ወርብዕ።</t:ab>
                    </t:div>
                </t:div>
                
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="desinit" xml:id="Desinit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:label>Desinit</t:label>
                    <t:ab><t:gap reason="omitted"/> ኦዘፈወሰከ፡ አመ፡ ሕማመ፡ ወሲድ፡ ፅኡዕ፡ አምጣን፡ አንተ፡ ብፁዕ፡ አናንያ፡ ሰማዕት፡ ወየዋህ፡ በገዕ፡ አእርግ፡ ጸሎተነ፡ ውስተ፡ ኦኃ፡ ሰማይ፡ ሰብእ፡ ምስለ፡ ካህናት፡ ፳ወርብዕ። ኦመተንብለን፡ አናንያ፡ ወጳውሎስ፡ መምህርራነ፡ ወንጌል፡ ሐዳስ፡
                        ዘፈወሰክሙ፡ ዓይና፡ ለብእሲተ፡ ተጽናስ፡ ወዒስ፡ አድኅኑነ፡ አበው፡ እምተጽናስ፡ ወባዕሰ፡ ወለለጎዑ፡ ዑድዋ፡ ለዛቲ፡ መቅደስ። ተፈጸመ፡ ገድል፡ ወተአምር፡ ዘአቡነ፡ አናንያ፡ ጸሎቱ፡ ወበረከቱ፡ የሃሉ፡ ለኵሎሙ፡ ደቂቀ፡ ማኅበር፡ ለዓለመ፡ ዓ</t:ab>
                </t:div>
              
                </t:div>
        </t:body>
    </t:text></TEI>